  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify seven real local net10 Math assemblies with bounded managed PE metadata inspection, exact DLL and public API SHA-256, native/RID asset refusals and an explicit observed-host support matrix. Recover one compiled RED, pass 36 independent GREEN tests, eight new pinned NuGet probes, two retained eight-probe consumers and seven archive inspections. Admit neither cross-version ABI nor unobserved OS or portable performance. Close C02 only; M5-W02 and M5 remain open.",
    "value": "Expose auditable current managed Math public API and binary identities from actual nupkg content without loading arbitrary code, inventing cross-version source/binary compatibility, native loader support, OS certification or public package publication.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS077 success, prepare M5-W02-C03-T1 release evidence and ten V1 criteria mapping, retaining G-M5 and any owner-controlled stable/public publication authorization as separate gates.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Observe a compiled missing public MathPackageRuntimeSurfaceAudit RED against the previous qualified distribution preview.3 before staging the preview.4 auditor.",
      "Inspect actual seven local net10 managed PE assemblies, CLI IL-only metadata, public method/field signatures, SHA-256, required distribution entrypoints and allowed runtime reference names.",
      "Refuse foreign native/RID archive content, malformed managed metadata and unsafe oversized public API inventories; do not load, execute or extract inspected assemblies.",
      "Retain source/binary compatibility and all untested OS RID certification as explicit false claims; documented resource budgets do not constitute portable throughput or latency SLAs.",
      "Recover the compiled RED and pass 36 independent real-assembly GREEN tests, locked Release build and pertinent Math component regressions.",
      "Inspect seven locally packed NuGet archive hashes, then run eight new independent source-free API/NuGet probes and verify each current managed binary digest directly from ZIP bytes.",
      "Preserve prior eight-probe clean NuGet client using its already-qualified local feed directory and rerun the original eight-probe mathematical console pinned to preview.4.",
      "Close C02-T2 RED/GREEN/verification, task and C02 only. Keep M5-W02, M5, C03, G-M5 and all stable/public release gates open.",
      "Repair the RS077 pre-attempt filesystem-mutation refusal by reusing original T2 nupkg paths; allow the retained clean consumer only the exact T1/T2 local feed names and remove direct directory/file mutations from the payload.",
      "Repair RS077 retry 2 after pre-attempt full-suite failure: retain all 40 T1 tests, compare the positive package identity with the current declared manifest and use incompatible version 9.9.9 for the negative fixture; run T1 tests before the full suite."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M5-W02-C02-T2-R",
        "achievement": "Observe genuinely compiled missing managed public API and native/RID audit RED before deploying its implementation."
      },
